/-! # Normalized word-image tensors of the identification Root8[22]+ <-> Root8[22]+ (record
r8f:R816+, e = 1)

The net field values of the packed tensors `wR8fR816pTHX` and `wR8fR816pTGX` (divided by `2 ^ 20`
and `2 ^ 21`), stored as compact literals and certified by one cross-sum check per column; the
parts evaluate no word image. -/

